<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="overline">Comparison &middot; ISO 20022 Structured Addresses &middot; November 2026 Deadline</div>
    <h1>GeoPostCodes vs <span class="grad-text">ioNova ARS</span><br>&mdash; one is already inside the other</h1>
    <p class="lead">GeoPostCodes is a high-quality global postal reference <em>data</em> product &mdash; the very dataset ioNova ARS embeds as its 246-country verification layer. It is not a parser: comparing them is a category question, not a product race. A bank that licenses ARS already receives the benefit of GeoPostCodes data without separate procurement.</p>
    <div class="hero-badges">
      <span class="badge badge-green">ioNova ARS &middot; Recommended</span>
      <span class="badge badge-amber">GeoPostCodes &middot; Data layer &mdash; already inside ARS</span>
      <span class="badge badge-info">Source: 25-criterion analysis, May 2026</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-band">
      <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-value">4.90 <span style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted)">vs</span> <span style="font-size:20px;-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--text-muted)">1.07</span></div><div class="kpi-label">Composite score / 5.00</div></div>
